OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMild
OL,6,Fand windy on Monday with rain, heavy
OL,7,Fin west. Early rain on Tuesday, heavy
OL,8,Fin west, then dry and bright. Showers
OL,9,Fin west Wednesday, dry east.
